{"feeds": {"type": "feed", "id": "187347118949140480", "url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/feed/d3a9e4d6f125cc98d1691dbc30cd97fec7ae2d03.xml", "title": "字节跳动技术团队", "description": "字节跳动的技术实践分享\n(wechat feed made by @ttttmr https://wechat2rss.xlab.app)", "siteUrl": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/feed/d3a9e4d6f125cc98d1691dbc30cd97fec7ae2d03.xml", "image": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Q3auHgzwzM4Mz0zV5VtfHx3vA6LLNw3npTWibbGbYhtsc131DoN6m0A/0", "errorMessage": null, "errorAt": null, "ownerUserId": null}, "entries": {"feedId": "187347118949140480", "id": "1167476866433392640", "title": "沙发搬到线上：火山引擎视频云如何用 RTC+直播打造一场“云上陪看房”？", "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI1MzYzMjE0MQ==&mid=2247520434&idx=1&sn=a64546f280df6673c7cceb76d3465a6e", "content": "<p>原创 <span>视频与边缘</span> <span>2026-06-22 17:00</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  <p><img src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=c3c5f67e&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FFGB4hYw9FeerFg90k9q0D8nAtMhh6LSVGxS9G9P3Jj3OPFrM8ichguFObH56t3I9VsHPib2Vf7vB8q7cSNSfeKgz8LuiaAdZsxEqtn6yLMJeYI%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\"></p>\n  \n  <div style=\"font-size: 15px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px 8px;box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\"><div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 20px 0px 10px;width: 100%;align-self: flex-start;padding: 24px;background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);border-radius: 10px;overflow: hidden;box-shadow: rgb(255, 255, 250) 1px 1px 5px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>真正让人愿意长时间看完一场球的，不只是比赛本身，而是有人一起看、一起喊、一起等那个关键时刻。</span></p></div><div style=\"font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>不同步，</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>是陪看体验的头号破坏者</span></strong></p></div><div style=\"text-align: unset;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>一个人看球最难受的不是错过精彩镜头，而是情绪来了却没人分享。进球想喊一嗓子，身边是空的；裁判出争议判罚想骂两句，只能对着屏幕自言自语。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>线上陪看房要还原的，正是一种“同步在场”的体验。但当直播与语聊不同步，那种本想靠线上找补的陪伴感，反而碎得更彻底。所以，技术方案的首要目标，是消除“错位感”。</span></p></div><div style=\"font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>火山引擎视频云，</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>用 RTC 守住每个同频瞬间</span></strong></p></div><div style=\"text-align: unset;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>火山引擎视频云围绕“同步在场”构建了一套完整的</span><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span> RTC</span></strong></span><span> 能力链，重点解决三个问题：</span><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>降低聊天链路延迟、应对高并发冲击、守住语音清晰度</span></strong></span><span>。</span></p></div><div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>第一，所有用户统一加入 RTC 房间，从源头保证同步。</span></strong></p></div></div></div><div style=\"text-align: unset;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>如果上麦用户正在语音里高喊“绝杀来了”，旁听用户晚两秒才听到，画面里的球可能就已经入网。火山引擎采用 RTC 互动语聊架构——无论上麦还是旁听，所有用户都加入同一个 RTC 房间。依托 RTC 稳定支持超百万人同时在线的能力，确保不同地区的球迷收到的音视频同步，把“边看边聊”真正变成同频互动。</span></span></p></div><div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>第二，融合方案兼顾并发性能与交互体验。</span></strong></p></div></div></div><div style=\"text-align: unset;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>热门比赛时，单个“边看边聊”房间可能涌入数百人。常规方案下，订阅端需要拉多路音频流，对手机电量和性能都是考验。火山引擎 RTC 设计“公共流+有房间”的融合方案：用户默认订阅公共流，只拉 1 路聚合音频，大幅降低客户端压力；从旁听切换至上麦时，无缝转为常规 RTC 方案，保证语音延时控制在毫秒级，支持单流 10 万量级的并发订阅。</span></span></p></div><div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>第三，多级容灾保护，应对进退房洪峰。</span></strong></p></div></div></div><div style=\"text-align: unset;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>开球前和终场哨响后，数百万人同时进退房，对云端形成瞬时冲击。火山引擎 RTC 采用“边缘+中心”多级限流：边缘节点做分布式 QPS 限流，中心按令牌桶控制请求速率，并配合房间数限流保护系统稳定运行。对于退房和断连请求，则通过队列延时处理、平滑发送至中心信令系统，避免瞬时流量集中冲击，支撑百万量级并发场景下的稳定运行。</span></span></p></div><div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>第四，音频优化守住外放场景下的语音清晰度。</span></strong></p></div></div></div><div style=\"text-align: unset;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>多数球迷用手机外放看球，直播声音被麦克风采集后会形成回声；进球呐喊声、现场声和解说声也可能盖过好友语音。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>为此，火山引擎 RTC 针对观赛场景进行了专门优化：一方面通过音频托管与回声消除能力，从源头减少外放带来的干扰；另一方面结合深度学习算法，在保证回声抑制效果的同时尽可能保留直播原声质感。与此同时，智能音频闪避能力会在检测到好友发言时自动降低直播音量，让解说、比赛和聊天各归其位。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>这四层能力叠加，让线上陪看从“各看各的”变成“同处一个时间轴”。技术没有喧宾夺主，它只是守住了那份进球时一起呐喊的默契。</span></p></div><div style=\"font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>不止人与人：</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>AI 陪看让观赛更懂你</span></strong></p></div><div style=\"text-align: unset;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>同频互动之外，火山引擎视频云引入 AI 陪看，将赛事知识、球员数据与问答服务嵌入观赛过程，让泛球迷“看得懂”、深度球迷“有得聊”。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>针对看球场景的复杂声场、情绪打断和事件同步需求，RTC 提供三层能力：精准拾音（过滤解说与杂音）、极速打断响应（毫秒级全双工）、事件触发式低延迟响应（进球/VAR 毫秒级广播）。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>集成方案上，可选 RTC 全托管快速上线语音问答助手，或 RTC+三方 Custom Agent 打通赛事数据库，实现“问答+推荐集锦/球员卡片”联动，提升停留时长与转化。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>AI 陪看不是聊天机器人，而是一种增强型互动服务——让一个人在家看球，也能随时问规则、聊战术。</span></p></div><div style=\"font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>卡塔尔世界杯，</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>验证百万级陪看能力</span></strong></p></div><div style=\"text-align: unset;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>火山引擎智能视频云的互动陪看能力已在 2022 年卡塔尔世界杯期间得到大规模验证。抖音上线的“边看边聊”功能，单房间支持 500 人同时在线，其中 9 人可上麦实时语音，其余旁听。所有用户统一接入 RTC 房间，依靠融合方案实现单流超大规模并发。据官方数据，尝试该功能的用户超过 1000 万，有效互动提升 5-10 倍，用户看播时长显著增长。</span></p></div><div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=65649498&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FFGB4hYw9FedUAfzVOd901iaAPuIzhmZ5335sH5O1YVIcjoVK8hPCRxicacrGB4rSg6qGYk5OJqBFCFp81nibB9zoAI7DWZwVF8Smh0trn4kgAk%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p></div><div style=\"text-align: unset;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>当一句“好球”与一次传球几乎同时抵达好友耳中，当进球后的呐喊和画面里的球入网同步发生，技术才算真正退到了幕后。留下的，是那一刻共享的心跳和齐声的呐喊——这才是火山引擎视频云“云上陪看房”想要给观众带来的体验。</span></p></div><div style=\"text-align: unset;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>作为抖音大型赛事直播背后的主力技术底座，火山引擎视频云特别推出《大型赛事直播与互动实战指南》。从超低延时直播、极清沉浸观赛到 AI 陪看与智能二创玩法，深度浓缩抖音在历届世界杯、亚运会中的顶流实战经验。为您提供开箱即用的技术与玩法解法，极速抢占赛事增长先机！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 60, 59);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>点击</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>阅读原文</span></strong></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>，</span></span><span>获取</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;line-height: 2;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);text-align: unset;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>「</span></span><span>大型赛事云上直播与互动实战指南」</span></p></div><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></div><p style=\"display: none;\"></p>\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.volcengine.com/contact/docs/livebroadcast\" target=\"_blank\">阅读原文</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/link-proxy/?k=50080b63&#x26;r=1&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%3F__biz%3DMzI1MzYzMjE0MQ%3D%3D%26mid%3D2247520434%26idx%3D1%26sn%3Da64546f280df6673c7cceb76d3465a6e\" target=\"_blank\">跳转微信打开</a></p>", "description": "原创 视频与边缘 2026-06-22 17:00 北京 真正让人愿意长时间看完一场球的，不只是比赛本身，而是有人一起看、一起喊、一起等那个关键时刻。\n\n不同步，\n\n是陪看体验的头号破坏者\n\n一个人看球最难受的不是错过精彩镜头，而是情绪来了却没人分享…", "guid": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI1MzYzMjE0MQ==&mid=2247520434&idx=1&sn=a64546f280df6673c7cceb76d3465a6e", "author": null, "authorUrl": null, "authorAvatar": null, "insertedAt": "2026-06-22T13:07:30.847Z", "publishedAt": "2026-06-22T09:00:00.718Z", "media": [{"url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=c3c5f67e&u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FFGB4hYw9FeerFg90k9q0D8nAtMhh6LSVGxS9G9P3Jj3OPFrM8ichguFObH56t3I9VsHPib2Vf7vB8q7cSNSfeKgz8LuiaAdZsxEqtn6yLMJeYI%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg", "type": "photo", "width": 898, "height": 383}, {"url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=65649498&u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FFGB4hYw9FedUAfzVOd901iaAPuIzhmZ5335sH5O1YVIcjoVK8hPCRxicacrGB4rSg6qGYk5OJqBFCFp81nibB9zoAI7DWZwVF8Smh0trn4kgAk%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg", "type": "photo"}], "categories": null, "attachments": null, "extra": {}, "language": null, "summary": "Volcano Engine Video Cloud uses RTC (Real-Time Communication) technology to create synchronized \"cloud co-viewing\" experiences for sports streaming. Its solution addresses four key challenges: eliminating audio-video sync delays through unified RTC rooms; handling high concurrency via a hybrid public stream plus room-based architecture; implementing multi-level disaster recovery for massive simultaneous join/leave events; and optimizing audio clarity through echo cancellation and intelligent audio ducking. The platform also offers AI co-viewing with real-time Q&A and data services. During the 2022 Qatar World Cup, Douyin's \"watch-and-chat\" feature supported 500 users per room with 10 million participants, increasing interaction 5-10x."}, "settings": {}}